                {%- comment -%}
                  Centered spinner shown while the .zoomed-in-image src is
                  downloading. .preview-zoom-loader is shown by the
                  `.zoom-box,.zoom_image` click handler in
                  pdp_transferBySize.js right before assigning the new src,
                  and hidden by a one-shot load/error listener so a failed
                  load doesn't leave the spinner stuck on. Without this,
                  gang-sheet PNGs (multi-MB) take a few seconds to stream
                  in and the modal previously showed a blank box.
                {%- endcomment -%}
