              /* Lightbox close-button & scroll fixes for gang-sheet
                 picker. The default `.md-lightbox__close` (defined in
                 my-designs-panel.liquid) is a thin × glyph at 0.8
                 opacity — very hard to spot when the lightbox is
                 stacked on top of an already-dim picker modal. Bump it
